/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/b3c4ddd767a3f2a00c22bbc1b8d8ffd5.webm?t=1784651279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/b3c4ddd767a3f2a00c22bbc1b8d8ffd5.mp4?t=1784651279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space exploration can be hard work. Sometimes it's a good idea to zoom out, and look at things from a different angle. Space can be quite relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/d0f96a0b9a00c16652515a693ad172f8.poster.avif?t=1784651279\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/d0f96a0b9a00c16652515a693ad172f8.webm?t=1784651279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/d0f96a0b9a00c16652515a693ad172f8.mp4?t=1784651279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship's computer serves as the interface for every station. Offline stations only offer low-level file access, including configurations, logs, and data archives. Browse directories, read and download files; coordinates and research leads are often hidden in the details. Just keep in mind that every access is logged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.poster.avif?t=1784651279\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.webm?t=1784651279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/extras/93c5957f3fd9119a4e959aa441cc46ef.mp4?t=1784651279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Single-player, first-person spaceflight sim. Fly a fast, agile ship through dense asteroid fields. Scan anomalies and sell scientific data at Science Labs—just don’t crash: you’ll lose it. Hack probes and satellites to access hidden secrets, then jump through unstable wormholes before they collapse.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/header.jpg?t=1784651279", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/ef2c7cf4119a6e3ca88a192ff400b51076b1ed8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784651279", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974010/ef2c7cf4119a6e3ca88a192ff400b51076b1ed8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784651279", "website": "https://www.redvery.space", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-3570K or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 780 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6700 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>